      {
        "day": 3,
        "session_template_id": "leg_day_template",
        "cardio_if_any": null
      },
      {
        "day": 4,
        "session_template_id": "push_day_template",
        "cardio_if_any": null
      },
      {
        "day": 5,
        "session_template_id": "pull_day_template",
        "cardio_if_any": "20min_LISS_post_workout"
      },
      {
        "day": 6,
        "session_template_id": "leg_day_template",
        "cardio_if_any": null
      },
      {
        "day": 7,
        "is_rest_day": true,
        "activities": ["stretching", "light_walk_30min"],
        "recovery_focus": "Sleep 8+ hours, hydration, stress management"
      }
    ],
    "applies_to_weeks": [1, 2, 3],
    "progression_notes": "Each week, attempt to add 1 rep per set OR increase weight by smallest increment available when you hit top of rep range"
  }
}
```

**Efficiency Rule**: If the training split is consistent (e.g., PPL repeated), generate the session templates ONCE and reference them. Only generate variations if research justifies it (e.g., deload week, periodization phase shift).

